<title>UK: RUGBY UNION-WALES BEAT SCOTLAND 34-19.</title>
<headline>RUGBY UNION-WALES BEAT SCOTLAND 34-19.</headline>
<dateline>EDINBURGH 1997-01-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wales beat Scotland 34-19 (halftime 10-13) in their Five Nations rugby union match at Murrayfield on Saturday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Scotland - Try: Scott Hastings. Conversion: Rowan Shepherd. Penalties: Rowan Shepherd (3). Drop goal: Craig Chalmers.</p>
<p>Wales - Tries: Scott Quinnell, Neil Jenkins, Arwel Thomas, Ieuan Evans. Conversions: Neil Jenkins (4). Penalties: Neil Jenkins (2)</p>
</text>
